/target
/.codeowl
__pycache__/

# Local Claude Code session state (settings.local.json) and any stray
# copy of a slash command under commands/ -- CodeOwl's own copy of
# /codeowl-generate deliberately lives in setup/, not here (see the
# aefdc42 commit message: "its honest home is the distributable guide,
# as the single versioned source to copy into a target repo"). A repo
# CodeOwl is installed *into* may legitimately track its own .claude/
# commands/ -- that convention is unaffected; this is about this repo.
/.claude
